# Normalise line endings so the repository does not churn between
# Windows (CRLF) and Linux (LF) checkouts. Vercel and GitHub Actions both
# build on Linux, so the working copy is forced to LF as well.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Keep generated or binary files out of the text rules above.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.pdf binary
*.ico binary
package-lock.json -diff
